# --- SOCIETIES ---

### Read Societies
GET http://localhost:3000/societies

### Read Society by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/societies/2

### Society Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/societies/2/stats

### Create Society
POST http://localhost:3000/societies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "COECEPT",
    "raisonSociale": "Microphina Finance COECEPT",
    "identifiant": "MF-002",
    "email": "contactcoecept@microphina.com",
    "telephone": "+22890000000",
    "adresse": "Lomé, Togo"
}

### Update Society
PUT http://localhost:3000/societies/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nom": "COECEPT TOGO"
}

### Delete Society
DELETE http://localhost:3000/societies/1


