# --- MOUVEMENT EPARGNES ---

### Read Mouvement Epargnes
GET http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes

### Read Mouvement Epargne by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes/1

### Mouvement Epargne Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes/1/stats

### Mouvement Epargne History
GET http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes/1/history

### Create Mouvement Epargne
POST http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reference": "ME-0001",
    "type": "VERSEMENT",
    "montant": 25000,
    "soldeAvant": 100000,
    "soldeApres": 125000,
    "dateMouvement": "2026-01-12T10:00:00.000Z",
    "statut": "VALIDE",
    "observations": "Versement épargne client",
    "agenceId": 2,
    "clientId": 1,
    "compteId": 1,
    "creeParId": 2
}

### Update Mouvement Epargne
PUT http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "observations": "Versement validé"
}

### Delete Mouvement Epargne
DELETE http://localhost:3000/mouvement-epargnes/1


